msgid "This page will show you how to setup an Odroid with a Wifi AccessPoint so that the Odroid's hard drive can be accessed and modified from another computer.  This is primarily aimed at allowing access to images, videos and log files on the Odroid.  The procedure makes use of `hostapd <http://wireless.kernel.org/en/users/Documentation/hostapd>`__, `Samba <https://www.samba.org/>`__ and `dhcp <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dynamic_Host_Configuration_Protocol>`__."
msgstr ""

